message: 'If you use Bandcraft in teaching or research, please cite the software version you used.'
title: 'Bandcraft: A Local-First IELTS Practice Studio for Firefox'
type: software
authors:
  - name: 'Bandcraft contributors'
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-27
url: 'https://github.com/johnlikescarrot/ielts'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/johnlikescarrot/ielts'
license: MIT
keywords:
  - IELTS
  - language learning
  - spaced repetition
  - retrieval practice
  - shadowing
  - Firefox extension
  - local-first software
abstract: >-
  Bandcraft is a free, no-login, local-first Firefox extension for deliberate
  IELTS vocabulary, reading, writing, listening, and speaking practice. It
  combines FSRS review, explicit page capture, timed production, subtitle-aligned
  shadowing, local recording, bilingual English/Vietnamese UI, and transparent
  data export without transmitting learner data.
